{#
  The persona switcher strip.

  `personaSwitcher` is put on `res.locals` by `personaSwitcherLocals()` (`src/auth/persona-switcher.ts`)
  and is absent unless both halves of the gate agree, so the `if` below is the whole of the render-time
  condition — there is no page-level flag to forget and no way for a page to show a control this process
  would refuse to honour.

  **One submit button per persona, and no `<select>`.** Decision 6 requires a real submit rather than a
  `GET` link, and three named buttons need no JavaScript, no `onchange` enhancement and no progressive
  -enhancement story at all: each button carries its own `value`, which is what a browser posts. The
  current persona is text rather than a button, since there is nothing to switch to.

  **A persona this environment cannot offer is text too, with its reason on the line below.** A disabled
  button invites a click that does nothing and says nothing; the point of task 5 is that the tester learns
  the judicial role is not published here rather than concluding the switcher is broken. And when *no*
  persona can be obtained — the IDAM client is registered for neither grant type — `notice` replaces the
  form entirely: there is nothing to post, so rendering a form would be an invitation to find that out the
  hard way.

  The visually-hidden "Switch to" prefixes the accessible name so the three buttons do not all announce
  as "Switch", while the visible label stays the persona's name — the strip has to stay one line.

  Deliberately **not** `govukServiceNavigation`: this must never read as part of the service in a
  screenshot (decision 5). Adopting service navigation properly is loose end 15 and separate work.
#}
{% if personaSwitcher %}
  <div class="app-persona-switcher">
    <strong class="govuk-tag govuk-tag--red app-persona-switcher__tag">{{ personaSwitcher.tag }}</strong>
    <span class="app-persona-switcher__label">{{ personaSwitcher.label }}</span>
    {% if personaSwitcher.notice %}
      <p class="app-persona-switcher__reason">{{ personaSwitcher.notice }}</p>
    {% else %}
      <form method="post" action="{{ personaSwitcher.action }}" novalidate>
        <ul class="app-persona-switcher__list">
          {% for persona in personaSwitcher.personas %}
            <li class="app-persona-switcher__item">
              {% if persona.isCurrent %}
                <span class="app-persona-switcher__current">{{ persona.name }} ({{ personaSwitcher.current }})</span>
              {% elif not persona.isAvailable %}
                <span class="app-persona-switcher__unavailable">{{ persona.name }} ({{ personaSwitcher.unavailable }})</span>
              {% else %}
                <button type="submit" name="persona" value="{{ persona.id }}" class="govuk-button govuk-button--inverse app-persona-switcher__button" data-module="govuk-button">
                  <span class="govuk-visually-hidden">{{ personaSwitcher.switchTo }} </span>{{ persona.name }}
                </button>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </form>
      {% for persona in personaSwitcher.personas %}
        {% if persona.reason %}
          <p class="app-persona-switcher__reason">{{ persona.name }}: {{ persona.reason }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}
